Description: Tools to define, plot and prepare objects to 
  implement correlation models defined over a specific DAG. 
  These objects can be used for modeling multivariate outcomes, 
  correlation in the latent level or among latent parameters. 
  Uses of it with internal matrices objects are built 
  in order to use the 'INLA' package (<https://www.r-inla.org>).
  These objects contain data to for the 'cgeneric' interface in
  'INLA', enabling fast parallel computations.
